{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-env-promotion","title":"多环境晋升策略：用 GitOps 实现 dev→staging→prod 流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/patterns/multi-env-promotion","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"多环境晋升策略-用-gitops-实现-dev-staging-prod-流水线\">多环境晋升策略：用 GitOps 实现 dev→staging→prod 流水线</h1><p>多环境晋升是 GitOps 落地的第一个实质性挑战。你有一套代码，需要先在 dev 验证，然后晋升到 staging，再经过审批进入 production。在传统 CI/CD 中，这通常是 Pipeline 的多个 stage；在 GitOps 中，晋升本质上是<strong>更新 Git 仓库中特定环境配置的操作</strong>，由调谐器自动同步到集群。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>晋升（Promotion）</td>\n<td>将一个版本从低环境（dev）迁移到高环境（staging/prod）的操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo</td>\n<td>所有应用和所有环境的配置存储在同一个 Git 仓库中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置仓库（Config Repo）</td>\n<td>与应用代码仓库分离的专用 GitOps 配置仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批门（Approval Gate）</td>\n<td>晋升到生产环境前必须经过的人工审批步骤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Branch Protection Rules</td>\n<td>Git 平台对特定分支的保护规则，强制要求 PR + 审批 + 状态检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>定义每个目录变更必须由哪些人审批的规则文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"git-仓库结构的三种模式\">Git 仓库结构的三种模式</h2><p>仓库结构决定了晋升的操作方式和权限隔离粒度。没有最优解，只有最适合团队的方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式一-单仓库-目录隔离-monorepo\">模式一：单仓库 + 目录隔离（Monorepo）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"fleet-infra/                     # 单个 Git 仓库&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   ├── payment-service/&#10;│   │   ├── base/&#10;│   │   └── overlays/&#10;│   │       ├── dev/&#10;│   │       │   ├── kustomization.yaml&#10;│   │       │   └── values.yaml&#10;│   │       ├── staging/&#10;│   │       │   ├── kustomization.yaml&#10;│   │       │   └── values.yaml&#10;│   │       └── production/&#10;│   │           ├── kustomization.yaml&#10;│   │           └── values.yaml&#10;│   └── auth-service/&#10;│       └── ...&#10;├── infrastructure/&#10;│   ├── cert-manager/&#10;│   └── ingress-nginx/&#10;└── clusters/&#10;    ├── dev/&#10;    │   └── apps.yaml            # Argo CD Application 或 Flux Kustomization&#10;    ├── staging/&#10;    │   └── apps.yaml&#10;    └── production/&#10;        └── apps.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fleet-infra/                     # 单个 Git 仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── payment-service/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── base/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── overlays/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       ├── dev/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       │   ├── kustomization.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       │   └── values.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       ├── staging/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       │   ├── kustomization.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       │   └── values.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       └── production/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │           ├── kustomization.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │           └── values.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── auth-service/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── infrastructure/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── cert-manager/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── ingress-nginx/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── clusters/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── dev/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── apps.yaml            # Argo CD Application 或 Flux Kustomization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── staging/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── apps.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── production/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── apps.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：小团队（&lt;10人），所有人都有全仓库权限，不需要细粒度的权限隔离。</p>\n<p><strong>晋升操作</strong>：将 <code>dev/values.yaml</code> 中的 image tag 复制到 <code>staging/values.yaml</code> 并提交 PR。</p>\n<p><strong>优点</strong>：简单、所有环境的变更历史在同一个仓库，横向比较容易。</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：无法限制&quot;只能修改自己应用的配置&quot;，生产配置和开发配置混在一起。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-按环境分仓库\">模式二：按环境分仓库</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"fleet-infra-dev/          # dev 环境仓库（所有开发者可写）&#10;├── apps/payment-service/&#10;&#10;fleet-infra-staging/      # staging 环境仓库（需要 PR + review）&#10;├── apps/payment-service/&#10;&#10;fleet-infra-production/   # production 环境仓库（严格保护，需要多人审批）&#10;├── apps/payment-service/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fleet-infra-dev/          # dev 环境仓库（所有开发者可写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/payment-service/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fleet-infra-staging/      # staging 环境仓库（需要 PR + review）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/payment-service/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fleet-infra-production/   # production 环境仓库（严格保护，需要多人审批）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/payment-service/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：有明确的安全合规要求，生产环境的访问需要严格控制。</p>\n<p><strong>晋升操作</strong>：从 dev 仓库 cherry-pick 或手动将变更 PR 到 staging 仓库。</p>\n<p><strong>优点</strong>：每个环境独立权限控制，生产仓库可以配置严格的 Branch Protection Rules。</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：维护多个仓库，跨仓库追踪变更历史较复杂。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式三-app-代码仓库-config-仓库分离\">模式三：App 代码仓库 + Config 仓库分离</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"payment-service/          # 应用代码仓库（开发者的主战场）&#10;├── src/&#10;├── Dockerfile&#10;└── .github/workflows/&#10;    └── ci.yml            # CI：构建镜像，触发 config 仓库更新&#10;&#10;fleet-infra/              # 配置仓库（GitOps 操作对象）&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   └── payment-service/&#10;│       ├── dev/&#10;│       ├── staging/&#10;│       └── production/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>payment-service/          # 应用代码仓库（开发者的主战场）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Dockerfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── .github/workflows/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── ci.yml            # CI：构建镜像，触发 config 仓库更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fleet-infra/              # 配置仓库（GitOps 操作对象）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── payment-service/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── dev/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── staging/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── production/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>这是目前最推荐的模式</strong>，原因：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>应用代码和配置代码的变更频率不同（代码频繁变更，配置相对稳定）</li>\n<li>不同角色的关注点分离（开发者关注代码，SRE/平台关注部署配置）</li>\n<li>CI/CD 流水线不需要访问配置仓库来构建代码</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"晋升触发机制\">晋升触发机制</h2><p>GitOps 中的&quot;晋升&quot;实际上是<strong>更新配置仓库中目标环境的配置文件</strong>，主要有四种触发方式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    CI[CI 构建新镜像] --&gt;|方式一:直接更新 Git| DevConfig[dev 环境配置]&#10;    DevCI[dev 验证通过] --&gt;|方式二:人工 PR| StagingConfig[staging 环境配置]&#10;    StagingPR[staging PR 合并] --&gt;|方式三:自动促进 CI| ProdConfig[prod 环境配置]&#10;    ProdConfig --&gt;|方式四:人工审批后合并| ProdApplied[prod 部署]\">graph LR\n    CI[CI 构建新镜像] --&gt;|方式一:直接更新 Git| DevConfig[dev 环境配置]\n    DevCI[dev 验证通过] --&gt;|方式二:人工 PR| StagingConfig[staging 环境配置]\n    StagingPR[staging PR 合并] --&gt;|方式三:自动促进 CI| ProdConfig[prod 环境配置]\n    ProdConfig --&gt;|方式四:人工审批后合并| ProdApplied[prod 部署]</pre><h3 id=\"方式一-ci-直接更新-git-dev-环境\">方式一：CI 直接更新 Git（dev 环境）</h3><p>CI Pipeline 构建镜像后，自动更新 dev 环境的 image tag：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;name: Build and Update Dev&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;jobs:&#10;  build-and-deploy:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Build and push image&#10;        run: |&#10;          docker build -t registry.example.com/payment:${{ github.sha }} .&#10;          docker push registry.example.com/payment:${{ github.sha }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Update dev config&#10;        run: |&#10;          # Checkout 配置仓库&#10;          git clone https://x-access-token:${{ secrets.CONFIG_REPO_TOKEN }}@github.com/example/fleet-infra.git&#10;          cd fleet-infra&#10;&#10;          # 更新 dev 环境的 image tag&#10;          cd apps/payment-service/overlays/dev&#10;          kustomize edit set image registry.example.com/payment=${{ github.sha }}&#10;          # 或者用 yq：&#10;          # yq eval &#39;.image.tag = &quot;${{ github.sha }}&quot;&#39; -i values.yaml&#10;&#10;          git config user.email &quot;ci-bot@example.com&quot;&#10;          git config user.name &quot;CI Bot&quot;&#10;          git add .&#10;          git commit -m &quot;feat(payment-dev): update image to ${{ github.sha }}&quot;&#10;          git push\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build and Update Dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build-and-deploy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build and push image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          docker build -t registry.example.com/payment:${{ github.sha }} .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          docker push registry.example.com/payment:${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Update dev config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # Checkout 配置仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git clone https://x-access-token:${{ secrets.CONFIG_REPO_TOKEN }}@github.com/example/fleet-infra.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          cd fleet-infra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 更新 dev 环境的 image tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          cd apps/payment-service/overlays/dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          kustomize edit set image registry.example.com/payment=${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 或者用 yq：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # yq eval '.image.tag = \"${{ github.sha }}\"' -i values.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git config user.email \"ci-bot@example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git config user.name \"CI Bot\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git add .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git commit -m \"feat(payment-dev): update image to ${{ github.sha }}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git push</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方式二-人工-pr-晋升到-staging\">方式二：人工 PR 晋升到 staging</h3><p>dev 验证通过后，由工程师创建 PR，将 dev 的配置&quot;晋升&quot;到 staging：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 实际操作（或通过脚本自动化）&#10;cd fleet-infra&#10;git checkout -b promote/payment-service-${COMMIT_SHA}-to-staging&#10;&#10;# 将 dev 的 image tag 更新到 staging&#10;cd apps/payment-service/overlays/staging&#10;kustomize edit set image registry.example.com/payment=${DEV_COMMIT_SHA}&#10;git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m &quot;feat(payment-staging): promote v${VERSION} from dev&quot;&#10;&#10;# 创建 PR，等待 Review + 自动化测试通过&#10;gh pr create --base main --title &quot;Promote payment-service to staging&quot; \\&#10;  --body &quot;Promoting commit ${COMMIT_SHA} after successful dev validation&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实际操作（或通过脚本自动化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fleet-infra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> promote/payment-service-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">${COMMIT_SHA}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-to-staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将 dev 的 image tag 更新到 staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/payment-service/overlays/staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kustomize</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> edit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/payment=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">${DEV_COMMIT_SHA}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat(payment-staging): promote v${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} from dev\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建 PR，等待 Review + 自动化测试通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --title</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Promote payment-service to staging\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --body</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Promoting commit ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">COMMIT_SHA</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} after successful dev validation\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方式三-自动晋升策略-需谨慎使用\">方式三：自动晋升策略（需谨慎使用）</h3><p>对于某些低风险的服务，可以配置自动晋升规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Flux ImagePolicy：staging 自动追踪 latest release&#10;# dev 使用精确 SHA，staging 可以使用 semver 范围&#10;apiVersion: image.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1beta2&#10;kind: ImagePolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-service-staging&#10;spec:&#10;  imageRepositoryRef:&#10;    name: payment-service&#10;  filterTags:&#10;    pattern: &#39;^v\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+-rc\\d+$&#39; # 只选 RC 版本（如 v2.1.0-rc3）&#10;  policy:&#10;    semver:&#10;      range: &#39;&gt;=2.0.0-rc0 &lt;3.0.0&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Flux ImagePolicy：staging 自动追踪 latest release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># dev 使用精确 SHA，staging 可以使用 semver 范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">image.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1beta2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ImagePolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service-staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  imageRepositoryRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  filterTags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^v\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+-rc\\d+$'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 只选 RC 版本（如 v2.1.0-rc3）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    semver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>=2.0.0-rc0 &#x3C;3.0.0'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方式四-生产环境的审批门\">方式四：生产环境的审批门</h3><p>生产环境的晋升通常需要经过多重审批：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Branch Protection Rules for production branch&#10;# 在 fleet-infra 仓库的 GitHub 设置中配置：&#10;# - Require 2 PR approvals&#10;# - Require status checks: integration-tests, security-scan&#10;# - Require signed commits (GPG)&#10;# - Include administrators（管理员也必须走 PR）&#10;# - Restrict who can merge（只有特定团队）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Branch Protection Rules for production branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 fleet-infra 仓库的 GitHub 设置中配置：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - Require 2 PR approvals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - Require status checks: integration-tests, security-scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - Require signed commits (GPG)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - Include administrators（管理员也必须走 PR）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - Restrict who can merge（只有特定团队）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"晋升流水线的完整设计\">晋升流水线的完整设计</h2><p>将以上机制组合成一个生产级的晋升流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开发者提交代码到 feature 分支] --&gt; B[PR 合并到 main]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CI: 构建 + 单元测试 + 镜像推送]&#10;    C --&gt; D[自动更新 dev/image.tag]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Argo CD/Flux 自动同步到 dev 集群]&#10;    E --&gt; F[集成测试 + E2E 测试 on dev]&#10;    F --&gt;|测试通过| G[工程师创建 staging PR]&#10;    F --&gt;|测试失败| H[告警:dev 测试失败,不晋升]&#10;    G --&gt; I[PR Review + CI 检查]&#10;    I --&gt; J[合并:staging 自动同步]&#10;    J --&gt; K[staging 验收测试 + 性能测试]&#10;    K --&gt;|通过| L[创建 production PR]&#10;    K --&gt;|失败| M[告警:staging 验证失败]&#10;    L --&gt; N[必须 2 人 Review + 安全扫描]&#10;    N --&gt; O[合并:production 自动同步]\">graph TD\n    A[开发者提交代码到 feature 分支] --&gt; B[PR 合并到 main]\n    B --&gt; C[CI: 构建 + 单元测试 + 镜像推送]\n    C --&gt; D[自动更新 dev/image.tag]\n    D --&gt; E[Argo CD/Flux 自动同步到 dev 集群]\n    E --&gt; F[集成测试 + E2E 测试 on dev]\n    F --&gt;|测试通过| G[工程师创建 staging PR]\n    F --&gt;|测试失败| H[告警:dev 测试失败,不晋升]\n    G --&gt; I[PR Review + CI 检查]\n    I --&gt; J[合并:staging 自动同步]\n    J --&gt; K[staging 验收测试 + 性能测试]\n    K --&gt;|通过| L[创建 production PR]\n    K --&gt;|失败| M[告警:staging 验证失败]\n    L --&gt; N[必须 2 人 Review + 安全扫描]\n    N --&gt; O[合并:production 自动同步]</pre><h2 id=\"环境差异的管理策略\">环境差异的管理策略</h2><p>不同环境之间的配置差异不应该只有 image tag，还有资源配置、副本数、域名等：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# overlays/dev/kustomization.yaml&#10;patches:&#10;  - target:&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      name: payment-service&#10;    patch: |&#10;      - op: replace&#10;        path: /spec/replicas&#10;        value: 1          # dev 只需要 1 个副本&#10;&#10;configMapGenerator:&#10;  - name: payment-config&#10;    literals:&#10;      - LOG_LEVEL=debug # dev 开启详细日志&#10;      - DB_HOST=dev-db.internal&#10;      - RATE_LIMIT=100 # dev 放宽限速&#10;&#10;---&#10;# overlays/production/kustomization.yaml&#10;patches:&#10;  - target:&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      name: payment-service&#10;    patch: |&#10;      - op: replace&#10;        path: /spec/replicas&#10;        value: 5          # production 高可用副本&#10;&#10;configMapGenerator:&#10;  - name: payment-config&#10;    literals:&#10;      - LOG_LEVEL=warn # production 减少日志量&#10;      - DB_HOST=prod-db.internal:5432&#10;      - RATE_LIMIT=1000 # production 正常限速\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># overlays/dev/kustomization.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">patches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    patch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - op: replace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        path: /spec/replicas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        value: 1          # dev 只需要 1 个副本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">configMapGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    literals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LOG_LEVEL=debug</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # dev 开启详细日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_HOST=dev-db.internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RATE_LIMIT=100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # dev 放宽限速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># overlays/production/kustomization.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">patches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    patch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - op: replace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        path: /spec/replicas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        value: 5          # production 高可用副本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">configMapGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    literals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LOG_LEVEL=warn</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # production 减少日志量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_HOST=prod-db.internal:5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RATE_LIMIT=1000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # production 正常限速</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"晋升自动化工具\">晋升自动化工具</h2><p>手动创建晋升 PR 是可行的，但有自动化工具可以简化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://kargo.io/\">kargo</a></td>\n<td>专为 GitOps 晋升设计，支持复杂的晋升策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/fluxcd/flux2-kustomize-helm-example\">flux-promote</a></td>\n<td>Flux 官方晋升示例模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Argo CD Image Updater</td>\n<td>结合 Argo CD，自动更新 image tag 并触发晋升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 CI Script</td>\n<td>用 GitHub Actions + yq/kustomize 实现轻量晋升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多环境晋升的 GitOps 实现本质上是&quot;在 Git 中更新目标环境的配置文件&quot;。三种仓库结构（Monorepo、按环境分仓库、App 代码 + Config 仓库分离）各有权衡，但 App+Config 分离模式是目前最推荐的起点。晋升触发机制从自动（CI 直接更新 dev）到半自动（PR 触发）到审批门（生产环境强制多人审批）形成梯度控制。Branch Protection Rules 和 CODEOWNERS 将审批流程代码化，使其成为强制执行的工程控制而非可绕过的流程规范。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>下一步：<a href=\"progressive-delivery-canary\">渐进式交付与金丝雀发布</a> 覆盖如何用 GitOps 控制流量逐步切换到新版本。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多环境晋升策略：用 GitOps 实现 dev→staging→prod 流水线","id":"多环境晋升策略-用-gitops-实现-dev-staging-prod-流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Git 仓库结构的三种模式","id":"git-仓库结构的三种模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：单仓库 + 目录隔离（Monorepo）","id":"模式一-单仓库-目录隔离-monorepo"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：按环境分仓库","id":"模式二-按环境分仓库"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：App 代码仓库 + Config 仓库分离","id":"模式三-app-代码仓库-config-仓库分离"},{"level":2,"text":"晋升触发机制","id":"晋升触发机制"},{"level":3,"text":"方式一：CI 直接更新 Git（dev 环境）","id":"方式一-ci-直接更新-git-dev-环境"},{"level":3,"text":"方式二：人工 PR 晋升到 staging","id":"方式二-人工-pr-晋升到-staging"},{"level":3,"text":"方式三：自动晋升策略（需谨慎使用）","id":"方式三-自动晋升策略-需谨慎使用"},{"level":3,"text":"方式四：生产环境的审批门","id":"方式四-生产环境的审批门"},{"level":2,"text":"晋升流水线的完整设计","id":"晋升流水线的完整设计"},{"level":2,"text":"环境差异的管理策略","id":"环境差异的管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"晋升自动化工具","id":"晋升自动化工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"配置管理：Kustomize 与 Helm 的选型决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/toolchain/config-management-kustomize-helm"},"next":{"title":"渐进式交付与金丝雀发布：用 GitOps 控制流量切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/patterns/progressive-delivery-canary"}}